# Negative controls for "an opponent sacrifices an artifact": Bot2 sacrificing a land (Prismatic Vista, no artifact) and Bot1
# sacrificing its own Black Lotus (not an opponent) deal nothing. Bot2 is on 19 (the Vista's life) and Bot1 on 20. The positive
# control, an opponent's sacrificed Black Lotus, is the sibling scenario.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Vengeful Tracker
Black Lotus
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Prismatic Vista
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Vengeful Tracker.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Prismatic Vista.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Prismatic Vista.Activate
Bot2.Search()
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot2.Life = 19
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Graveyard = Prismatic Vista
Bot1.Graveyard = Black Lotus
